      "checks": [
        {
          "request_id": "openstax_coordinates",
          "location": "modules/m81369/index.cnxml，行48–70",
          "locator": "m81369，fs-id1167834538411",
          "browse_url": "https://github.com/openstax/osbooks-prealgebra-bundle/blob/ad40c7e3c9a909cde81a24c526f52fe26a51fb14/modules/m81369/index.cnxml#L48",
          "finding": "有序对先横坐标后纵坐标。来源以通常几何平面为背景；本书只定义Q²为有理有序对集合，不能宣称所有实际几何点都有有理坐标。"
        },
        {
          "request_id": "openstax_coordinates",
          "location": "modules/m81369/index.cnxml，行88–97",
          "locator": "m81369，fs-id1167835330675",
          "browse_url": "https://github.com/openstax/osbooks-prealgebra-bundle/blob/ad40c7e3c9a909cde81a24c526f52fe26a51fb14/modules/m81369/index.cnxml#L88",
          "finding": "横轴点的第二坐标为零，纵轴点的第一坐标为零；书稿用集合定义并保留原点同时在两轴上。"
        },
        {
          "request_id": "openstax_coordinates",
          "location": "modules/m81369/index.cnxml，行291–302",
          "locator": "m81369，fs-id1167835350108",
          "browse_url": "https://github.com/openstax/osbooks-prealgebra-bundle/blob/ad40c7e3c9a909cde81a24c526f52fe26a51fb14/modules/m81369/index.cnxml#L291",
          "finding": "来源画三个点再连接的作图步骤只作展示参考；有限点不能证明函数在所有Q输入上的图，更不能把连笔曲线误作已构造的实连续点集。"
        },
        {
          "request_id": "openstax_coordinates",
          "location": "modules/m81369/index.cnxml，行458–472",
          "locator": "m81369，fs-id1167832075518",
          "browse_url": "https://github.com/openstax/osbooks-prealgebra-bundle/blob/ad40c7e3c9a909cde81a24c526f52fe26a51fb14/modules/m81369/index.cnxml#L458",
          "finding": "x=c为竖直，y=b为水平。固定输入x下竖直集合有多个输出，水平集合给出常函数。"
        },
        {
          "request_id": "openstax_coordinates",
          "location": "modules/m81369/index.cnxml，行705–718",
          "locator": "m81369，fs-id1167826874383",
          "browse_url": "https://github.com/openstax/osbooks-prealgebra-bundle/blob/ad40c7e3c9a909cde81a24c526f52fe26a51fb14/modules/m81369/index.cnxml#L705",
          "finding": "轴截点定义。书稿区分截点有序对与截距数值，补足零函数与非零常函数的横轴交集。"
        },
        {
          "request_id": "openstax_lines",
          "location": "modules/m81370/index.cnxml，行232–239",
          "locator": "m81370，fs-id1167834504980",
          "browse_url": "https://github.com/openstax/osbooks-prealgebra-bundle/blob/ad40c7e3c9a909cde81a24c526f52fe26a51fb14/modules/m81370/index.cnxml#L232",
          "finding": "水平斜率为零，竖直斜率因分母零而未定义，不写无穷大斜率。"
        },
        {
          "request_id": "openstax_lines",
          "location": "modules/m81370/index.cnxml，行330–335",
          "locator": "m81370，fs-id1167832041523",
          "browse_url": "https://github.com/openstax/osbooks-prealgebra-bundle/blob/ad40c7e3c9a909cde81a24c526f52fe26a51fb14/modules/m81370/index.cnxml#L330",
          "finding": "两点斜率差商，书稿必须显式要求x1≠x2；同一点与竖直两点另分支。"
        },
        {
          "request_id": "openstax_lines",
          "location": "modules/m81370/index.cnxml，行502–514",
          "locator": "m81370，fs-id1167834194235",
          "browse_url": "https://github.com/openstax/osbooks-prealgebra-bundle/blob/ad40c7e3c9a909cde81a24c526f52fe26a51fb14/modules/m81370/index.cnxml#L502",
          "finding": "斜截式y=mx+b。书稿称仿射函数，固定a,b∈Q，不引入尚未定义的线性空间。"
        },
        {
          "request_id": "openstax_lines",
          "location": "modules/m81370/index.cnxml，行972–987",
          "locator": "m81370，同斜率与不同截距",
          "browse_url": "https://github.com/openstax/osbooks-prealgebra-bundle/blob/ad40c7e3c9a909cde81a24c526f52fe26a51fb14/modules/m81370/index.cnxml#L972",
          "finding": "行972简说同斜率平行，行973的精确条件还要求不同纵截距；同斜率同截距是重合图，必须独立处理。竖直线斜率未定义。"
        },
        {
          "request_id": "openstax_functions",
          "location": "modules/m81373/index.cnxml，行56–60",
          "locator": "m81373，关系的domain/range",
          "browse_url": "https://github.com/openstax/osbooks-prealgebra-bundle/blob/ad40c7e3c9a909cde81a24c526f52fe26a51fb14/modules/m81373/index.cnxml#L56",
          "finding": "来源由关系的第一、第二坐标集合定义域和值域；本书函数三元组另含声明目标集合，不能只由图恢复任意目标集合。"
        },
        {
          "request_id": "openstax_functions",
          "location": "modules/m81373/index.cnxml，行195–202",
          "locator": "m81373，fs-id1167836614987",
          "browse_url": "https://github.com/openstax/osbooks-prealgebra-bundle/blob/ad40c7e3c9a909cde81a24c526f52fe26a51fb14/modules/m81373/index.cnxml#L195",
          "finding": "每个定义域输入恰一个输出；书稿须同时要求存在与唯一，包含空定义域边界。"
        },
        {
          "request_id": "openstax_graph_functions",
          "location": "modules/m81374/index.cnxml，行64–70",
          "locator": "m81374，fs-id1167833386905",
          "browse_url": "https://github.com/openstax/osbooks-prealgebra-bundle/blob/ad40c7e3c9a909cde81a24c526f52fe26a51fb14/modules/m81374/index.cnxml#L64",
          "finding": "竖线至多交一点只保证在第一坐标投影域上的函数性；对预先给定D还须每个x∈D至少有一点且不含D外输入。"
        },
        {
          "request_id": "openstax_graph_functions",
          "location": "modules/m81374/index.cnxml，行128–141",
          "locator": "m81374，fs-id1167829598148",
          "browse_url": "https://github.com/openstax/osbooks-prealgebra-bundle/blob/ad40c7e3c9a909cde81a24c526f52fe26a51fb14/modules/m81374/index.cnxml#L128",
          "finding": "图为全部(x,f(x))，不只是值表中有限样本。源实平面背景不直接继承到Q²。"
        }
      ]
    },
